bib('bott1967residue','article',dict(author='Bott, Raoul',title='A residue formula for holomorphic vector-fields',journal='Journal of Differential Geometry',volume=1,number='3--4',pages='311--330',year=1967,doi='10.4310/jdg/1214428096'),'https://celebratio.org/Bott_R/article/295/','Curated primary author bibliography opened, entry 45, with original abstract and publication metadata. The abstract distinguishes the earlier isolated nondegenerate-zero result from extensions to bundles and higher-dimensional nondegenerate zero loci. Full original article was not read in this run.')
bib('bruzzorubtsov2012localization','article',dict(author='Bruzzo, Ugo and Rubtsov, Vladimir',title='On localization in holomorphic equivariant cohomology',journal='Central European Journal of Mathematics',volume=10,number=4,pages='1442--1454',year=2012,doi='10.2478/s11533-012-0054-2',eprint='0910.2019',archivePrefix='arXiv'),'https://arxiv.org/pdf/0910.2019','Full author manuscript v4, stamped 21 March 2012, opened; institution-hosted version and publication metadata also opened. Theorem 3.2, section 3.4 (manuscript p. 11), and section 4.5 Proposition 4.6 were read. This is actual result verification of the localization formula, distinct from metadata checking of the 1967 original. First preprint 11 October 2009; journal 2012.')
bib('atiyahbott1967lefschetz','article',dict(author='Atiyah, Michael F. and Bott, Raoul',title='A Lefschetz fixed point formula for elliptic complexes. I',journal='Annals of Mathematics',volume=86,number=2,pages='374--407',year=1967,doi='10.2307/1970694'),'https://annals.math.princeton.edu/1967/86-2/p07','Existing cumulative key reused. Official journal metadata opened in this run; no full-text reading is asserted here. It supports the historical identity of the theorem named in the notebook, not a new proof of the infinitesimal relation.')
